2026-07-27T06:41:50.7498607Z Start test: reusing a cached on-disk driver does not record a storage choice
2026-07-27T06:41:50.7572295Z duckdb keeps downloaded extensions and secrets in a temporary directory:
2026-07-27T06:41:50.7572995Z i /tmp/RtmpASZtuF/duckdb
2026-07-27T06:41:50.7573364Z This is removed when the R session ends.
2026-07-27T06:41:50.7573865Z * Extensions are re-downloaded each session.
2026-07-27T06:41:50.7574771Z * Secrets are lost.
2026-07-27T06:41:50.7575541Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = TRUE) (or create ~/.duckdb) to keep them (suitable for most users).
2026-07-27T06:41:50.7576686Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = FALSE) to accept the temporary directory (and silence this message).
2026-07-27T06:41:50.7577718Z i See ?duckdb_storage for details and alternatives.
2026-07-27T06:41:50.7827859Z   'test-storage-message-once.R:52:3' [success]
2026-07-27T06:41:50.7935654Z   'test-storage-message-once.R:53:3' [success]
2026-07-27T06:41:50.8368261Z   'test-storage-message-once.R:59:3' [success]
2026-07-27T06:41:50.8531086Z End test: reusing a cached on-disk driver does not record a storage choice
